# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Voice Agent Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual credentials

# ── NVIDIA API Keys (REQUIRED) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your API keys from: https://build.nvidia.com/
# Used for: Speech-to-Text (STT), Text-to-Speech (TTS), and LLM inference

# Main NVIDIA API key for LLM inference
NVIDIA_API_KEY=your_nvidia_api_key_here

# Speech-to-Text API key (NVIDIA Riva)
STT_API_KEY=your_stt_api_key_here

# Text-to-Speech API key (NVIDIA Riva)
TTS_API_KEY=your_tts_api_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NOTES:
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1. This voice agent does NOT use Upstash Redis or Supabase directly.
#    It communicates with the RAG agent which handles memory.
#
# 2. All three API keys are required for full voice functionality:
#    - NVIDIA_API_KEY: For LLM processing
#    - STT_API_KEY: For converting speech to text
#    - TTS_API_KEY: For converting text to speech
#
# 3. SECURITY: Never commit .env files to version control. Keep credentials secret.
